{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"solar-panel-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"solar-panel-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["solar-panel-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Pagplano pagtatantya lamang, hindi isang garantiya ng produksyon o disenyo ng sistema. Output mga pagbabago sa panahon, lokal na panahon, lilim, direksyon, temperatura at kagamitan. Pagtitipid ipagpalagay bawat binuo kWh offsets isang binili kWh sa iyong ipinasok na rate; aktwal na sariling-gamitin, export credits, mga singil sa utility, insentibo, pagpapanatili at financing ay maaaring baguhin ang resulta. Tingnan ang mga lokal na kondisyon at mga kinakailangan ng koryente sa isang kwalipikadong solar propesyonal.","record_id":"422b0aca68b8a53e39fb4dce0e6e3a49b16658e29d72c5c52cef6f0adca3590a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.594546611999931,"source":"Planning estimate only, not a production guarantee or system design. Output changes with season, local weather, shade, orientation, temperature and equipment. Savings assume every generated kWh offsets a purchased kWh at your entered rate; actual self-use, export credits, utility fees, incentives, maintenance and financing may change the result. Check local conditions and electrical requirements with a qualified solar professional.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"50bb9d3e9d66352696cf20f4abc32794a87aecc958c98f2e618cbfc9ddc4933e","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Pagplano pagtatantya lamang, hindi isang garantiya ng produksyon o disenyo ng sistema. Output mga pagbabago sa panahon, lokal na panahon, lilim, direksyon, temperatura at kagamitan. 